<title>UK: Salomon sets warrants on the DAX index.</title>
<headline>Salomon sets warrants on the DAX index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers AG said it has issued 20 million call and put warrants, in ten equal tranches, on the DAX index.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 14.NOV.96-19.SEP.97   PAYDATE	13.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FRFT, STUTT, DUSS     SPOT REFERENCE  2,690</p>
<p>100 WARRANTS ARE EXERCISABLE INTO ONE INDEX.</p>
<p>* * * * * *</p>
<p> CALLS	  STRIKE	 ISSUE	 PREMIUM     GEARING</p>
<p> CALL 37	2400	   3.85 DEM    3.53 PCT    6.99 X</p>
<p> CALL 38	2600	   2.37 DEM    5.46 PCT    11.35 X</p>
<p> CALL 39	2800	   1.20 DEM    8.55 PCT    22.42 X</p>
<p> CALL 40	3000	   0.50 DEM    13.38 PCT   53.88 X</p>
<p> CALL 41	3200	   0.19 DEM    14.34 PCT   141.58 X</p>
<p> PUT 26	 2200	   0.19 DEM    18.92 PCT   141.57 X</p>
<p> PUT 27	 2400	   0.50 DEM    12.64 PCT   53.80 X</p>
<p> PUT 28	 2600	   1.00 DEM    7.06 PCT    26.90 X</p>
<p> PUT 29	 2800	   1.80 DEM    2.60 PCT    14.94 X</p>
<p> PUT 30	 3000	   3.25 DEM    0.56 PCT    8.28 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
